			"notes": "# World Height Limit 1.1.1\n\n## Added\n\n- Added Fabric Beta builds.\n- Added NeoForge Beta builds.\n- Added support for singleplayer worlds and modded dedicated servers.\n- Added automatic datapack generation for modded environments.\n- Added in-game height diagnostics with `/worldheightlimit info`.\n- Added loaded world height listing with `/worldheightlimit worlds`.\n- Added height configuration command: `/worldheightlimit set <height> confirm`.\n\n## Supported mod loaders\n\n- Fabric\n- NeoForge\n\n## Supported Minecraft versions\n\nFabric Beta:\n- `1.19.x`\n- `1.20.0-1.20.4`\n- `1.20.5-1.20.6`\n- `1.21.x`\n\nNeoForge Beta:\n- `1.20.2-1.20.4`\n- `1.20.5-1.20.6`\n- `1.21.x`\n\n## Notes\n\n- These builds are marked as Beta.\n- Fabric requires Fabric API.\n- Height changes require a full world/server restart.\n- Stable mod builds support heights up to `Y=2031`.\n- Higher limits may be added later as an experimental build."
		},
